  "description": "Noble Nook is a long castle layout with two towers joined by a rope bridge and a set of swings, so children cross from one turret to the other before sliding down. The pictured version is Lavender Dilly with Play Orange, and it is also available in Knight Blue with Sand Beige or Knight Blue with Play Yellow. It suits children aged 3 to 12, and play includes climbing, sliding and swinging. At 40' x 21'1\", with a safe play area of 45' x 26'1\", it works best along the length of a park or a rectangular school ground. Capacity is listed as 15 children. Our 3-year warranty on Noble Nook covers the galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Send us your plot dimensions and we will show how it sits on your site.",
